.shipment-container-ledger__col--route { width: 6%; } /* SIL-543: funds direction; place names are prose that wraps at spaces (5% broke tokens mid-word — the share stays). */
/* SIL-516 doctrine sweep (SIL-515 wrap-full): 9% holds the unbreakable date
